desc:
Beautiful Nearly BRAND NEW 1 bdrm condo in a highly desirable Raven Woods neighborhood. 

This spacious contemporary home features an open efficient layout, large kitchen with tons of storage space and top of the line appliances, 9' ceilings, laminate flooring throughout and a beautiful forest view. 

1 Large Storage Locker 

1 Parking Stall 

Building Amenities:

 - Fully equipped gym;

 - Party room with full kitchen, games and outdoor lounge;

 - Outdoor kids playground;

 - Rooftop lounge with fire pits;

 - Pet wash station; 

Unbeatable location:

 - Steps away from Cates Park & Sherwood Park Elementary;

 -Surrounded by a myriad of trails;

 - Walking distance to Dollarton & Parkgate plazas;

 - Deep Cove less than 10 minutes away;

 - Multiple Golf Courses within 10 minutes;

 - 22 Minutes to downtown.

Schools nearby:

 - Sherwood Park Elementary

 - Dorothy Lynas Elementary

 - Saint Pius X Elementary

 - Seycove Secondary

Pets allowed, no smoking.

Available July 1.

